  "examples": [
    {
      "coptic": "**ⲛⲑⲟϥ** ⲇⲉ ⲁϥⲉⲣϩⲏⲧⲥ ⲛⲉⲣⲁⲛⲁⲑⲉⲙⲁⲧⲓⲍⲓⲛ ⲛⲉⲙⲱⲣⲕ ϫⲉϯⲥⲱⲟⲩⲛ ⲙⲡⲁⲓⲣⲱⲙⲓ ⲁⲛ ⲉⲧⲉⲧⲉⲛϫⲱ ⲙⲙⲟϥ .",
      "english": "But he began to curse, and to swear, 'I don't know this man of whom you speak!'",
      "source": "Bohairic Gospel of Mark 14 (Digital Edition)",
      "urn": "urn:cts:copticLit:nt.mark.bohairic_ed:14",
      "dialect": "bohairic"
    },
    {
